# Application Constants

Centralize reusable literals and defaults instead of scattering magic values.

## Preferred locations

- Runtime/config defaults: `src/core/settings/config.py` (or dedicated constants module under `src/core/settings/`)
- DB-related constants: modules under `src/core/database/`
- Integration timeouts/retries: adapter modules under `src/core/adapters/`

## Rules

- Do not duplicate policy literals across business modules.
- Keep secrets out of constants files; read them from environment variables.
- After introducing a constant, use imports instead of copying raw literal values.

